{"sha":"024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","node_id":"C_kwDOSW8VZtoAKDAyNGQ4MTgxNGI0MDc2ZGVmMjQ1NjQyODE1MGE0YTJjZDg0MDk1ZGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"wizlijun","email":"me@bruce.com","date":"2026-11-10T10:47:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"wizlijun","email":"me@bruce.com","date":"2026-11-10T10:47:54Z"},"message":"chore: release Sumi focus and pointer fixes 6.1110.6","tree":{"sha":"bdd83cd02e3e915a18624f0ad3b6988974cea896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/git/trees/bdd83cd02e3e915a18624f0ad3b6988974cea896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/git/commits/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/commits/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","html_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/commit/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/commits/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"693e5feb9d9ffb15c84e8cbc84e06cb480c7a77e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/commits/693e5feb9d9ffb15c84e8cbc84e06cb480c7a77e","html_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/commit/693e5feb9d9ffb15c84e8cbc84e06cb480c7a77e"}],"stats":{"total":24,"additions":18,"deletions":6},"files":[{"sha":"7012207163782602afecb82167c57c712e2e832b","filename":"CHANGELOG.md","status":"modified","additions":7,"deletions":1,"changes":8,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/blob/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/CHANGELOG.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/raw/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/CHANGELOG.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/contents/CHANGELOG.md?ref=024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","patch":"@@ -7,10 +7,16 @@ For the full commit history, see the git log.\n \n ## Unreleased\n \n-## v6.1110.5 — 2026-11-10\n+## v6.1110.6 — 2026-11-10\n \n - **Stabilize Sumi focus writing on Linux.** Fix fractional scroll feedback that made the text jump between adjacent pixels. Hide the native editor scrollbar and frame while preserving scrolling and the input position outside focus mode.\n \n+- **Restore mouse input in the Sumi Linux editor.** Make the focus decoration’s own GTK window transparent to input so clicks, text selection and mouse-wheel scrolling reach the native body.\n+\n+## v6.1110.5 — 2026-11-10\n+\n+Unpublished validation build. Its focus-writing fix is included in v6.1110.6; this build failed the native mouse-input release gate.\n+\n ## v6.1110.4 — 2026-11-10\n \n - **Omarchy plugin windows and shortcuts.** Linux plugin windows open with a movable title bar, resize controls and an initial size fitted to the available desktop. App commands use Ctrl; Sumi uses F11 for fullscreen and keeps its controls reachable above the desktop dock. Fullscreen writing uses one proportional font scale and restores the saved size on exit."},{"sha":"742bea48ccad23e00122a20522362eed02a28112","filename":"CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md","status":"modified","additions":7,"deletions":1,"changes":8,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/blob/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/raw/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/contents/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md?ref=024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","patch":"@@ -6,10 +6,16 @@\n \n ## 未发布\n \n-## v6.1110.5 — 2026-11-10\n+## v6.1110.6 — 2026-11-10\n \n - **修复 Sumi Linux 聚焦书写抖动。** 消除居中计算的半像素滚动回授，让正文和候选保持稳定；隐藏原生正文滚动条及边框，保留正常滚动和非聚焦原位输入。\n \n+- **恢复 Sumi Linux 原生正文鼠标操作。** 让焦点装饰层自身的 GTK 窗口穿透输入，正文点击定位、拖选和滚轮不再被装饰层截获。\n+\n+## v6.1110.5 — 2026-11-10\n+\n+未公开的验收构建。聚焦修复随 v6.1110.6 交付；此构建未通过原生正文鼠标输入发布门禁。\n+\n ## v6.1110.4 — 2026-11-10\n \n - **调整 Omarchy 插件窗口与快捷键。** Linux 插件窗口恢复可拖动标题栏和缩放，启动尺寸适配可用桌面。应用命令统一使用 Ctrl，Sumi 以 F11 切换全屏，工具区避开桌面 Dock；全屏书写按单一比例调整字号，退出后恢复保存的字号。"},{"sha":"0d14d798c98a09ab4aeac8fa82c055ce7caee330","filename":"package.json","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/blob/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/package.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/raw/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/package.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/contents/package.json?ref=024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","patch":"@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n {\n   \"name\": \"notemd\",\n-  \"version\": \"6.1110.5\",\n+  \"version\": \"6.1110.6\",\n   \"type\": \"module\",\n   \"private\": true,\n   \"scripts\": {"},{"sha":"bef63a4393b5f747e03844d9f7f27a750a1463de","filename":"src-tauri/Cargo.lock","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/blob/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/src-tauri%2FCargo.lock","raw_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/raw/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/src-tauri%2FCargo.lock","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/contents/src-tauri%2FCargo.lock?ref=024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","patch":"@@ -3261,7 +3261,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"notemd\"\n-version = \"6.1110.5\"\n+version = \"6.1110.6\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"base64 0.22.1\",\n  \"block2\","},{"sha":"5ce979ffebe446a5e7f2f77354e150582730d470","filename":"src-tauri/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/blob/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/src-tauri%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/wizlijun/note.md/raw/024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de/src-tauri%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wizlijun/note.md/contents/src-tauri%2FCargo.toml?ref=024d81814b4076def2456428150a4a2cd84095de","pa